{"repositoryId":1415358670,"availability":"available","full":"deeplethe/solid-glass","name":"solid-glass","description":"A design system for AI applications. Material, physical, tactile, technical.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":1929,"forks":25,"created":"2026-10-12T09:19:02Z","updated":"2026-10-18T08:47:04Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://deeplethe.github.io/solid-glass","topics":["agent-ui","ai","ai-agents","chat-ui","design-system","llm","react","shadcn","shadcn-ui","tailwindcss","theme"],"demo":"https://deeplethe.github.io/solid-glass","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T09:16:59.674Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T09:16:59.674Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T09:16:59.674Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T09:16:59.674Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T11:16:38.256Z","stars":921,"forks":12},{"at":"2026-10-17T12:30:58.816Z","stars":1676,"forks":21},{"at":"2026-10-18T09:16:59.674Z","stars":1929,"forks":25}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A refined glass-inspired aesthetic that feels solid from afar and reveals its subtle materiality up close. Delicate highlights, fine borders, and soft shadows create depth, while a restrained finish emphasizes clarity, stability, and a sense of solidity over transparency, refraction, and fluidity.","That is one of the blocks: whole screens made of the components, to look at, read and copy in. Below, the components themselves.","It stands between flat design and liquid glass. Flat is an opaque block with no finish to speak of; liquid glass is nearly clear, and on a page with a lot of text the reader is always fighting the background for the words. Solid Glass lets only an outline through: enough to know it is glass, not enough to get in the way of reading."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/deeplethe/solid-glass/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cbdeeadde526ae3b2ed23383d0cc5786d44d5d3d56f